<title>UK: Paris 98 world air cargo expo space 50pct booked.</title>
<headline>Paris 98 world air cargo expo space 50pct booked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Air Cargo Association (TIACA) said exhibit space at its 19th International Air Cargo Forum and Exposition, due to be held in Paris from May 3-6, 1998, is nearly 50 percent booked.</p>
<p>TIACA invited exhibitors to register in May.</p>
<p>Last year's biennial forum held in Dubai attracted 3,200 attendees, 56 speakers and panelists and 262 exhibitors.</p>
<p>The association has said it expects to attract 20 percent more at the Paris event. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
